file construction/CHECKPOINTS.md the way back marked before the cut
file tools/fixtures/dated_path_exclusions.sh ten LISTED absences with their why
file tools/gen/chapter/horizon_stack_thin_witness.rish the Oven legs read Kiln; fossils read the record
file tools/gen/chapter/oven_seat_witness.rish the seat proven forward -- ember/ lives, oven/ retired
file foundations/README.md four elder clauses become the shed that took them
recommend keep-going -- the session-log date/ rule and its fold, then the writings sweep, then the Siya Fund and domain molts; each prepped, then shed on the same circled word
